⍝ Use the data-access layer instead of ⎕F… calls (read-only demo).
⍝ Run:  dyalog sample-scripts/component-files/use-store.apls
here←⊃1⎕NPARTS⊃2⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'
{}⎕FIX'file://',here,'Store.apln'
Store.Open here,'data'

c←Store.Customers
⎕←'customers: ',⍕c.name
z←Store.Customer 3
⎕←z.name,' lives in ',z.city,', credit limit ',⍕z.credit_limit
o←Store.OrdersFor 8
z←Store.Customer 8
⎕←'customer 8 (',z.name,') has ',(⍕≢o),' orders: ',⍕o.id
⎕←'their total: ',⍕+/{+/×/⍵[;2 3]}¨o.lines
